  abilityDesc: 3 combo powerful Water attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining
    HP), fills own BB gauge to max, boosts own max HP, considerably boosts own Atk,
    Def, Rec for 3 turns, enormously boosts own critical hit rate for 3 turns & considerably
    boosts own Spark damage for 3 turns
